# fixedbugs, defect 582, lane b19-pack, 2026-10-10, a shape beside
# `fixedbugs-582-a-header-s-unclosed-pack-push-leaves-two-modules-one-record-layout`:
# the push left open is in `fixedbugs-582-a-header-that-packs-itself.h`,
# which the group's header includes, and reached `main`'s records the same
# way. The close gives back the packing whichever header set it.

use fixedbugs582/pair

extern "fixedbugs-582-a-pack-push-in-a-header-the-group-s-header-includes.h"
    function llabs(x: i64) -> i64

function main()
    p = pair.make(llabs(-123456789))
    print(p.b, " ", pair.second(p), " ", pair.second(pair.Pair(a: 2, b: llabs(-987654321))))
    print(pair.area(pair.shape(llabs(-7))))
